{"id":27039,"author":"Walt","body":"\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"image-viewer horizontal\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/df8d77aece5e9af10407c1f948b5c888.png\" style=\"visibility: visible;\" title=\"Image: https://i.gyazo.com/df8d77aece5e9af10407c1f948b5c888.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBanner by Fouled\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHello,\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWe are happy and excited to announce our 5th tournament, \u003cb\u003eConquest Inc\u003c/b\u003e. This will be a CTF \u0026amp; 5CP/KoTH tournament.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eTournament Format\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe tournament will be a swiss-style tournament for the group stages, and double elimination for the invitationals.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e4 teams at minimum \u0026amp; 8 teams at maximum will be accepted into the invitationals, depends on the number of teams accepted.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBoth during the group stages and the invitationals the games will be bo5.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eA single match will run until completion or 12 minutes maximum, leaving 45 minutes per round slot.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eMap Pool\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe Map Pool will be announced and finalised on the 8th of April, but refer to our WIP Map pool until then.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIn the qualifiers, all rounds will have a set map set to each match, which will be announced with the teams being announced. We will have 5 maps in the tournament.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eTeam Information\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eOne team may not have less than 12 players registered, and no more than 18. All matches will be 8v8. Teams will need at least 6 players to participate in a match - if they do not have 6 when the match is scheduled to start, they will be disqualified.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eMatch Time\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eCheck in: 4:30pm BST / 11:30am EDT\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eMatches: 5pm BST / 12:00pm EDT\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eRegistration\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eTeam leaders will have to decide on a maximum of 18 players to register for the tournament. When registration opens, the team leaders will select 18 members of their choice to play in the tournament. Each player will have to confirm their own participation by pressing the 'accept' button in their alerts. You can register at the tournaments page when registration opens. That tournament will be created soon. If you have any concerns, please email\u0026nbsp;officials@avicus.net. Bear in mind, you can not add alts to your roster so your team can meet the requirements.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 17.5px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eImportant Dates:\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e(\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eYour team needs to consider that you could have to play on any of these dates when signing up:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e)\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eTournament Announcement: 2nd of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRegistration Opens: 8th of April \u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eMaps Announced: 8th of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRegistration Closes: 15th of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eTeams Announced: 15th of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eMatchups Announced: 22nd of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eGroup Stages: 29th and 30th of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eInvitationals: 6th/7th of May\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eDiscord\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eFor this tournament, we’re going to be\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eusing Discord instead of Teamspeak.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eThis is mainly due to teamspeak going down in previous tournaments, and Discord is more reliable and user-friendly. You can join the Discord server now with the link below.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eTo Note\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eYou agree to the Avicus ruleset and the Official Tournament ruleset by registering for this tournament.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eAll teams must have at least 1 member fluent in English in your team room at all times.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eAll teams must communicate through the official Avicus Tournament Discord Server. You may not play in your own teamspeak, mumble, skype call, discord server etc.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRegards,\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe Avicus Network's Official Team\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"image-viewer horizontal\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/df8d77aece5e9af10407c1f948b5c888.png\" style=\"visibility: visible;\" title=\"Image: https://i.gyazo.com/df8d77aece5e9af10407c1f948b5c888.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBanner by Fouled\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHello,\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWe are happy and excited to announce our 5th tournament, \u003cb\u003eConquest Inc\u003c/b\u003e. This will be a CTF \u0026amp; 5CP/KoTH tournament.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eTournament Format\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe tournament will be a swiss-style tournament for the group stages, and double elimination for the invitationals.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e4 teams at minimum \u0026amp; 8 teams at maximum will be accepted into the invitationals, depends on the number of teams accepted.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBoth during the group stages and the invitationals the games will be bo5.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eA single match will run until completion or 12 minutes maximum, leaving 45 minutes per round slot.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eMap Pool\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe Map Pool will be announced and finalised on the 8th of April, but refer to our WIP Map pool until then.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIn the qualifiers, all rounds will have a set map set to each match, which will be announced with the teams being announced. We will have 5 maps in the tournament.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eTeam Information\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eOne team may not have less than 12 players registered, and no more than 18. All matches will be 8v8. Teams will need at least 6 players to participate in a match - if they do not have 6 when the match is scheduled to start, they will be disqualified.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eMatch Time\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eCheck in: 4:30pm BST / 11:30am EDT\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eMatches: 5pm BST / 12:00pm EDT\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eRegistration\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eTeam leaders will have to decide on a maximum of 18 players to register for the tournament. When registration opens, the team leaders will select 18 members of their choice to play in the tournament. Each player will have to confirm their own participation by pressing the 'accept' button in their alerts. You can register at the tournaments page when registration opens. That tournament will be created soon. If you have any concerns, please email\u0026nbsp;officials@avicus.net. Bear in mind, you can not add alts to your roster so your team can meet the requirements.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 17.5px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eImportant Dates:\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e(\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eYour team needs to consider that you could have to play on any of these dates when signing up:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e)\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eTournament Announcement: 2nd of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRegistration Opens: 8th of April \u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eMaps Announced: 8th of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRegistration Closes: 15th of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eTeams Announced: 15th of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eMatchups Announced: 22nd of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eGroup Stages: 29th and 30th of April\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eInvitationals: 6th/7th of May\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eDiscord\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eFor this tournament, we’re going to be\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eusing Discord instead of Teamspeak.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eThis is mainly due to teamspeak going down in previous tournaments, and Discord is more reliable and user-friendly. You can join the Discord server now with the link below.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 17.5px; border-left: 5px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eTo Note\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eYou agree to the Avicus ruleset and the Official Tournament ruleset by registering for this tournament.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eAll teams must have at least 1 member fluent in English in your team room at all times.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eAll teams must communicate through the official Avicus Tournament Discord Server. You may not play in your own teamspeak, mumble, skype call, discord server etc.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRegards,\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe Avicus Network's Official Team\u003c/div\u003e","created_at":1491085749,"title":"Conquest Inc. - Information Post","replies":[{"id":364788,"author":"Diabolicx","body":"Hyperino","body_tagged":"Hyperino","created_at":1491166569},{"id":364789,"author":"poofywoo","body":"SECOND","body_tagged":"SECOND","created_at":1491166621},{"id":364790,"author":"Riilo","body":"HYPERINO PAPAPAPAPAPAPAPAPAPARINO","body_tagged":"HYPERINO PAPAPAPAPAPAPAPAPAPARINO","created_at":1491166695},{"id":364796,"author":"Tethium","body":"idc im playing Paladins","body_tagged":"idc im playing Paladins","created_at":1491166841},{"id":364798,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"The banner lmao","body_tagged":"The banner lmao","created_at":1491166929},{"id":364799,"author":"imryaan","body":"h0t","body_tagged":"h0t","created_at":1491167045},{"id":364800,"author":"dev_revs","body":"Here it goes :)","body_tagged":"Here it goes :)","created_at":1491167214},{"id":364801,"author":"ImTheRealBakugo","body":"HYYYYPE. But I can't play :(((((","body_tagged":"HYYYYPE. But I can't play :(((((","created_at":1491167434},{"id":364807,"author":"cellish","body":"Hypee!!!","body_tagged":"Hypee!!!","created_at":1491168769},{"id":364808,"author":"ViceTechnicolour","body":"I'm sorry but that banner does not look good at all","body_tagged":"I'm sorry b