":1491227413},{"id":364898,"author":"imryaan","body":"+1","body_tagged":"+1","created_at":1491234428,"reply_to":364808},{"id":364913,"author":"ICHlBAN","body":"will there be streamer/caster applications for the tournament?","body_tagged":"will there be streamer/caster applications for the tournament?","created_at":1491239751},{"id":364914,"author":"PokerFace","body":"That happened a long time ago. The Media Applications are closed already and probably won't open again until after this tournament.","body_tagged":"That happened a long time ago. The Media Applications are closed already and probably won't open again until after this tournament.","created_at":1491239909,"reply_to":364913},{"id":364926,"author":"ICHlBAN","body":"can non-media rank players stream/cast the tournament though? since i can stream avicus smoothly","body_tagged":"can non-media rank players stream/cast the tournament though? since i can stream avicus smoothly","created_at":1491245818,"reply_to":364914},{"id":364933,"author":"dev_revs","body":"No, only media members are permitted.","body_tagged":"No, only media members are permitted.","created_at":1491247158,"reply_to":364926},{"id":365042,"author":"Thepawer","body":"Hype","body_tagged":"Hype","created_at":1491311730},{"id":365047,"author":"Verybadsorry","body":"\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/d6d97baaa\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/d6d97baaa\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCHECK YOUR REPLY LOL","body_tagged":"\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/d6d97baaa\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/d6d97baaa\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCHECK YOUR REPLY LOL","created_at":1491316040,"reply_to":364803},{"id":365049,"author":"zicuri","body":"Is there any media application? \u0026nbsp;If so I can make your tournament better","body_tagged":"Is there any media application? \u0026nbsp;If so I can make your tournament better","created_at":1491317961},{"id":366291,"author":"_DISTRACTION_","body":"The registration deadline has been extended by one day.","body_tagged":"The registration deadline has been extended by one day.","created_at":1492287249},{"id":366292,"author":"Sueeeh","body":"WoW thanks!!! ;)","body_tagged":"WoW thanks!!! ;)","created_at":1492287674}]}